  "question": {
    "text": "A gas is allowed to expand at constant temperature from a volume of 1.0 L to 10.1 L against an external pressure of 0.50 atm. If the gas absorbs 250 J of heat from the surroundings, what are the values of q, w and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></math>? (Given 1 L atm = 101.0 J)",
